{"unit_id":"tomowang__dsh-tui#card-zh","repo":"tomowang/dsh-tui","commit":"ec8d8a98c080f6b014d647ff3aab2126b2ed8009","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tui 是 DSH 的交互式终端客户端扩展，通过 Cordis bundle 接入 dsh-base，在真实 TTY 中创建或恢复 Agent 会话，并显示持久化事件。它提供模型与 Agent preset 管理、会话恢复、轨迹和工具调用查看、上下文统计，以及计划、目标、审批和问题交互。用户通过命令、快捷键和 @ 文件补全控制会话，适合希望在命令行使用 DSH 的人。需要 Node.js 22.19 系列或 24 以上版本，stdin 和 stdout 必须连接到 TTY；模型与工具来自 DSH profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:931","src/index.ts:1038","src/startup.ts:37","src/tui/TuiApp.ts:534","src/tui/commands.ts:15"]}
{"unit_id":"tomowang__dsh-tui#card-en","repo":"tomowang/dsh-tui","commit":"ec8d8a98c080f6b014d647ff3aab2126b2ed8009","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tui is DSH’s terminal interface over dsh-base as a Cordis bundle. It creates or resumes sessions, shows logged conversations, and offers model/preset controls, tool and context views, approval prompts, @ file completion, and shell input. Requires Node.js 22.19.x or 24+ and stdin/stdout TTYs.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:931","src/index.ts:1038","src/startup.ts:37","src/tui/TuiApp.ts:534","src/tui/commands.ts:15"]}
